PhoenixAdult is a Plex metadata provider (FastAPI port of the legacy Python
Plex agent) that scrapes scene metadata -- titles, dates, studios, genres,
performers and artwork -- from a large set of adult sites and serves it to
Plex over HTTP.

It exposes a small web UI for configuration and a people-image cache with
optional face-detection headshot cropping.

Because several of its Python dependencies are not in the ports tree, the
application is installed into a dedicated per-host virtualenv on first start
(a one-time network fetch of the PyPI dependencies).
